{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03840","headline":"单于川对雨二首 二 · 苏味道","name":"单于川对雨二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"飞雨欲迎旬，浮云已送春。\n还从濯枝後，来应洗兵辰。\n气合龙祠外，声过鲸海滨。\n伐邢知有属，已见静边尘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苏味道","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03840.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03840","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}